                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b54a29f2-0d76-4812-b15d-9ff4938011f8",
                        "entry_id": "d9b20041-e6de-3e5c-b3c1-9f76b045548a",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "enjoûment"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                        "entry_id": "d9b20041-e6de-3e5c-b3c1-9f76b045548a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gaieté douce, badinage léger."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e128716-cf98-403f-b3e6-e794f57fa72c",
                                "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                                "text": "Il n’y avait plus rien chez lui de l’enjouement et de l’assurance brillante de l’homme à la mode ; il ne songeait plus à plaire au public, et, s’il se souvenait de l’existence de ce monstre, ce n’était que pour craindre ses réflexions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c074a08e-677e-4f31-af49-7695f385dafc",
                                "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                                "text": "[…] Modeste aperçut un vieillard en perruque blonde, frisée à petites boucles, dont la figure calme, pleine, lisse, offrait un sourire paternel et l’expression d’un enjouement monastique rendu presque digne par un regard à demi voilé."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "097c8745-7e57-4bce-af1c-0de7a933baa5",
                                "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                                "text": "L’effroi rentrait dans son cœur à mesure qu’il lui devenait plus nécessaire de paraître calme et confiante, et son âme s’attristait de l’enjouement de ses paroles et de son visage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9492ac17-2482-46e6-a7a2-d51dc1c29e1d",
                                "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                                "text": "Il plaisantait, sachant que la gaieté hâte souvent les solutions difficiles. Et, en effet, ils continuèrent à régler avec enjouement les détails de ce qu’il y aurait à faire, si le ministère était battu le lendemain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4448da9d-c36c-4492-a600-2b6c90b2a740",
                                "sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                                "text": "Il songe à tout, aux plus petites choses. Il crayonne de malicieux portraits, raconte avec enjouement des anecdotes spirituelles, […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "33eb59b5-00a9-423b-8714-afb65a991129",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9b20041-e6de-3e5c-b3c1-9f76b045548a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                        "target_lang_word": "playfulness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "playfulness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3461542-0b20-3053-88f7-16b0fd1f2bd3",
                                        "entry_id": "9a3d9789-e24b-32a6-992c-8779c1f3614b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being playful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac5747e2-553d-46c5-9dc9-9bfee6712ff2",
                                                "sense_id": "b3461542-0b20-3053-88f7-16b0fd1f2bd3",
                                                "text": "Jones’ sad eyes betray a pervasive pain his purposefully spare dialogue only hints at, while the perfectly cast Brolin conveys hints of playfulness and warmth while staying true to the craggy stoicism at the character’s core."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0f951ea2-edf2-4df9-becf-8d769d08f200",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9b20041-e6de-3e5c-b3c1-9f76b045548a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5df09d09-9798-3c40-a50c-52be90d4180e",
                        "target_lang_word": "cheerfulness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cheerfulness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86438433-9995-312b-a425-48f481e9554e",
                                        "entry_id": "22992355-ca5c-36ce-8567-edbb80c94af2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being cheerful; joy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50aa49d1-e64f-4ddc-8391-7d8377c3d509",
                                                "sense_id": "86438433-9995-312b-a425-48f481e9554e",
                                                "text": "Or he that exhorteth, on exhortation: he that giueth, let him doe it with simplicitie: hee that ruleth, with diligence: hee that sheweth mercy, with cheerefulnesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d546bda-b067-418d-8b73-1f63d0495500",
                                                "sense_id": "86438433-9995-312b-a425-48f481e9554e",
                                                "text": "The banded ones were all dressed in white gowns - a gay survival from Old Style days, when cheerfulness and May-time were synonyms - days before the habit of taking long views had reduced emotions to a monotonous average."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
